### Download stored user report file
GET {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports/11/download
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update import record status (Imported | Validated | Error | Archived)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/import_user_reports/8/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Validated"
}

### Delete import record (also removes stored file)
